Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Extend arms and bend wrists\Nat precisely 90 degrees,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.12,0:00:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,making sure to keep each finger straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.94,0:00:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then palms up in front, straighten elbows,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whilst maintaining the 90\Ndegree angles, bend each finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.94,0:00:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four, five.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.74,0:00:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now open your hands back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four, five.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.14,0:00:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And done?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you are ready to draw manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's begin, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.76,0:01:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
