Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.08,0:01:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you haven't forgotten about\Nthe 45-page one-shot, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.86,0:01:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you at least settled on a story yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.44,0:01:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm. One moment.
