Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.58,0:01:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an amazing hook! I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.06,0:01:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know what else sounds cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:02:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if you drew for us a manga about buying\Na beautiful holiday villa in the hills?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.68,0:02:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.28,0:02:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like you're into the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.24,0:02:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's such a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you hold on just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.28,0:02:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to explain what you\Nmeant by a villa in the hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.08,0:02:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was an idea for a story,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.70,0:02:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but like you could also\Ntotally go and do it for real
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.50,0:02:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and see if maybe a bolt of\Ninspiration strikes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.42,0:02:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop acting like you\Ndon't know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.38,0:02:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took issue with the buying\Npart of what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know full well that\NI recently declared
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.20,0:02:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bankruptcy due to a purchase\Nof that very nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.86,0:02:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan Sensei, I don't want anything\Nfrom you other than a good story.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.26,0:02:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.90,0:02:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite the discovery, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.90,0:02:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a little village nestled in\Nthe hills with no connecting roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet it's got about\Na dozen luxury villas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.84,0:02:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you never would\Nhave guessed there was a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.98,0:03:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,place like this just a few\Nhours northwest of Morioh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.38,0:03:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so weird seeing\Nsuch a developed patch
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.02,0:03:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of land without any roads or power lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.68,0:03:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not hooked up to a power\Ngrid or any other public utility.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.78,0:03:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet they've got working\Nelectricity and transportation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.62,0:03:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging from all those helipads,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.32,0:03:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to assume that these\Npeople get around mainly by air.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.06,0:03:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.16,0:03:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It certainly seems like\Nthey can afford it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And is it me, or does that building by\Nthe tennis court have an Isetan logo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.48,0:03:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it does!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have one there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.24,0:03:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the moment, one of those\Nvillas is accessible to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.22,0:03:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, for three million yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.02,0:03:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you finally admit you're\Nselling me real estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.66,0:03:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still wrong. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.72,0:03:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing I want you to do is draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.04,0:03:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one buying a house will be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.96,0:03:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You? Now let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.72,0:04:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's 2,600 square meters\Ngoing for 3 million yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.10,0:04:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On my salary, I could probably get a\Nloan for it or even buy it outright.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.90,0:04:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.32,0:04:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could commute from my\Napartment during the week,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then retreat to the countryside and kick\Nback during the weekend and holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.10,0:04:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow down for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.34,0:04:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You forced me to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.42,0:04:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this coming out of your pocket\Nor from the publishing company?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.15,0:04:21.44,Note,Rohan,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}TL Note: Company which publishes Weekly Shonen Jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.50,0:04:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was planning to do\Nthis with my own money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm to draw a manga about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, once again, this is\Nall to inspire you, silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.54,0:04:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I've put a lot of thought into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll share with you all\Nthe info I dug up to prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.40,0:04:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The owner of Villa No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,1 is the president of\Na shipbuilding company.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.73,0:04:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,2 belongs to a pharma CEO.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.50,0:04:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While the guy in No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.68,0:04:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,3 owns a printing company.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the guy in number four\Nruns a cosmetics business.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.90,0:04:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Needless to say, all the people living\Nhere are fancy-pants millionaire types.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.94,0:04:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With their trophy wives and cute kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.66,0:04:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a dream, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.46,0:05:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Collecting data is one thing, but\Nmaking sense of it all is quite another.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.92,0:05:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For starters, how does a villa\Nhere go for only three million?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.54,0:05:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be a catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.16,0:05:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except there isn't, Rohan-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.90,0:05:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've yet to tell you the most\Nimportant thing about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.88,0:05:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 11 people who live\Nhere all bought their lots.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.50,0:05:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when they were just 25 years\Nold can you Believe it I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah they're super loaded\Ntoday but all of them came up
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.94,0:05:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from humble beginnings The\Nmost recent arrival in this
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.02,0:05:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,village bought his plot of\Nland number 11 back in 1989
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.38,0:05:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the man Was a modest 25 year\Nold delivery driver who had
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.52,0:05:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,moved all the way out there\Nfrom tokyo And now he's the head
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.26,0:05:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,honcho of a big airline company\Nworth over 30 billion yen
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.50,0:05:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So yeah, there's not a single person\Nliving in this village who came for money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were all just ordinary\N25-year-old dudes who moved
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.12,0:05:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out here one by one and built\Nup their fortunes over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.76,0:05:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you've probably noticed, but it\Nlooks like there's a common number.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As it happens, I'm also\N25 years old. Get it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.86,0:06:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's clearly a story here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.94,0:06:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now be honest, don't you want to come\Nsee me get a lucky villa of my own?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm assuming you have access to a chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.10,0:06:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see how else we'd get there.
