Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.78,0:07:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan Sensei, there's one more important\Ndetail I forgot to mention earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.06,0:07:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The seller is the head of the village\Ncouncil, and they're very fussy about decorum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.42,0:07:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard they're dead set\Nagainst selling their land
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.32,0:07:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to anyone whom they think\Ncomes across as disrespectful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Proper manners will make\Nall the difference today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.08,0:07:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I hope you'll be\Non your best behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.82,0:07:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fail to see how my conduct will endanger\Nanything when the only buyer is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.94,0:07:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.10,0:07:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just spell it out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.98,0:07:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter which one\Nof us commits the faux pas,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.64,0:07:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll just lump us together\Nand toss us both out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.96,0:07:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't want to leave\Nempty-handed after that hike.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.26,0:07:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if anyone's\Never told you this before,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.98,0:07:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you always act like some hotshot diva\Nwho's addicted to his own flatulence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.24,0:07:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.15,0:07:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.24,0:07:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means stop worshipping\Nyourself and be a good boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or the locals will boot us before\Nyou can smell one more fart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.98,0:07:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:07:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's practice before we go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.16,0:08:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Traditionally, where in the house\Nshould a visitor take their jacket off?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.70,0:08:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem set on wasting my\Ntime with this nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.24,0:08:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The answer is at the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not once you've come inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.72,0:08:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before you pass through the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.90,0:08:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just in case there's\Nlingering dirt on your coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.52,0:08:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.43,0:08:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you do know how to behave!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.81,0:08:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand this visit takes precedence,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.76,0:08:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but perhaps we should\Ndo something about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean that chick over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.50,0:08:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.32,0:08:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The simplest explanation would be\Nthat it fell down from its nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.28,0:08:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we leave him, he might\Nget eaten by something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or freeze to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.60,0:08:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if that happens, we could\Nsimply write it off as nature's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thing we found you, little Fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.54,0:08:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.64,0:08:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I hung on to\Nthis box. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.74,0:09:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's likely his nest is\Nin one of these trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.46,0:09:02.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should come back\Nhere later and find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.20,0:09:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good day to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.42,0:09:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to begin by thanking\Nyou for coming all this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.84,0:09:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm glad to see that good weather\Nwas accommodating to your long journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.22,0:09:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.58,0:09:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.60,0:09:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us proceed swiftly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Izumi Kyoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.58,0:09:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for sparing\Nus some of your precious
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.36,0:09:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time to discuss the sale\Nof your lovely estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.52,0:09:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This gentleman here is my\Ngood friend Rohan Kishibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.62,0:09:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a successful manga artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may call me IQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.10,0:09:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been given the great honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.62,0:09:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of facilitating your visit today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.68,0:09:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please follow me as I guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, if you would kindly allow\Nme to relieve you of your coats.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.30,0:10:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, you may enter at your leisure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.94,0:10:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.68,0:10:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In just a moment, I shall go fetch the\Nseller with whom you will transact.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.04,0:10:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make yourselves comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.74,0:11:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm beginning to suspect that the test\Nhas already been put into motion, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about our etiquette.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.62,0:11:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There may be rules\Nsurrounding tea drinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.38,0:11:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they're waiting to see\Nhow we approach our cups.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.56,0:12:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow, I get the feeling\Nwe're being observed right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.74,0:12:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know the proper way of proceeding?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.74,0:12:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or should I just go straight\Nto consulting the internet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.44,0:12:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.94,0:12:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the buyer, I should\Nbe able to handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.68,0:12:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't trouble yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.38,0:12:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows the polite way of drinking\Nis quietly and without acting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.06,0:12:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.68,0:12:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sincerely regret to inform\Nyou of this, but sadly,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.60,0:12:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the seller is no longer\Ninterested in meeting with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.02,0:12:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must ask you to leave the premises now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It pains me to say it, but we cannot\Nabide your etiquette mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.62,0:12:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Izumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no land to sell to\Nanyone who lacks manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.48,0:13:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please return home for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.26,0:13:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.86,0:13:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.77,0:13:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I do wrong? Firstly,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though you are a guest in this house,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.22,0:13:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it is improper to take the\Nfurthest seat from the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.42,0:13:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unless it is offered to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.35,0:13:20.69,Seats Caption,Caption,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\pos(264,827)\be1}Entrance
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.35,0:13:20.69,Seats Caption,Caption,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\pos(632,579)\fs61\b1}➃ {\fs55\b0}Guest Seat{Trans note: The “guest seats” in JP are literally “low seats”, while what I called the “chief seats” are called “high seats”.}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.73,0:13:20.69,Seats Caption,Caption,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\pos(846,75\fs61)\b1}➂ {\fs55\b0}Guest Seat
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.10,0:13:20.69,Seats Caption,Caption,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\pos(1242,675)\fs61\b1}➁ {\fs55\b0}House Seat
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.48,0:13:20.69,Seats Caption,Caption,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\pos(1640,137)\fs61\b1}➀ {\fs55\b0}House Seat
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.96,0:13:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should take the closest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.56,0:13:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are expected to remain there until you\Nhave been properly greeted by the host.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.60,0:13:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Secondly,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.92,0:13:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it is improper to tread on the edges\Nof the tatami mats in a Japanese room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.76,0:13:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And third,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.94,0:13:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when sitting at a table lower\Nthan the level of your knees,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.82,0:13:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it is correct to hold\Nyour tea by the saucer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.82,0:13:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, to put your finger through the\Nhandle of the teacup is unspeakably vulgar.
