Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.04,0:13:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good etiquette is a simple organization\Nof shoulds and should-nots.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.68,0:13:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no gray area.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.46,0:13:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again, I must ask you to return home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.58,0:13:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean we're finished already?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.86,0:14:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.88,0:14:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said it's just for today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.10,0:14:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean it'd be\Npossible for me to try again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.30,0:14:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if it does, I'd\Nsincerely appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give it this time. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.94,0:14:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one more try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.96,0:14:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's not too much to ask, I\Npromise I won't disappoint you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.42,0:14:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let me prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.54,0:14:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you would like to attempt\Nthe trial one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.30,0:14:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I understand you correctly?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.32,0:14:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only if that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.08,0:14:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.46,0:14:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, I will present your\Nrequest to the Master for an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.14,0:14:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.98,0:14:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you won't regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.94,0:14:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's just leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.76,0:14:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There aren't any good manga\Nideas to be found here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.68,0:14:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would leave if I weren't\Nso in love with this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, they're strict about etiquette,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.74,0:14:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that's what I'd expect.\NJust look around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.66,0:14:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Kyoka speaking
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.96,0:15:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.96,0:15:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.34,0:15:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.46,0:15:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.80,0:15:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got news my mother was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.28,0:15:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said that she...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.04,0:15:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a car accident,\Nand she didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.36,0:15:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My boyfriend was there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.62,0:15:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were making plans to\Nfinally get married next year,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.18,0:15:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he was in the car with\Nmy mother at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.14,0:15:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then she suddenly got a\Nheart attack at the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.26,0:15:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've both been taken from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.96,0:15:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.38,0:15:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did these insects come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.66,0:15:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.86,0:16:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Master has agreed to let you\Ntake the trial of manners once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.36,0:16:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let us proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.82,0:16:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will reveal yourself this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heaven’s Door!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.28,0:16:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the guide at the main gate,\Nand the land speaks through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.04,0:16:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When crossing into this domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.78,0:16:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those lacking proper\Netiquette will soon find
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.86,0:16:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,themselves also lacking\Nsomething that they cherish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.02,0:16:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without exception, this is\Nthe punishment of the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.96,0:16:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One will gain, or one will lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the fundamental rule\Nwhich governs this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.90,0:16:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those proficient in\Netiquette will gain success.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who are not will\Nsuffer for each offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.36,0:16:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This young man is no stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.06,0:16:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems he's little more than a\Nguide and mouthpiece for these beings,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.22,0:16:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with no special abilities of his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.46,0:16:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This bodes terribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.48,0:16:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears our enemies\Nare the gods of the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.88,0:17:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the three rules she\Nbroke, she lost three things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.32,0:17:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She then further transgressed when\Nshe begged for another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.90,0:17:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impudence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.81,0:17:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On top of that, turning\Nsomeone into a book?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.28,0:17:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and reading their mind without permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.24,0:17:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is also an egregious act of disrespect!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.46,0:17:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.32,0:17:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This... this is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.32,0:17:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.23,0:17:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my chest!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears Miss Izumi is currently\Nsuffering a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.52,0:17:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan Kishibe,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.62,0:17:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have broken one rule of etiquette,\Nand so you will lose one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.20,0:17:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, do you intend\Nfor her to die? You first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.78,0:18:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you intend to continue with the trial,\Nor would you prefer to return home now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.62,0:18:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I can't. Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.24,0:18:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't leave her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I beg of you, have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her only transgression was\Nyearning for a chance at happiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.78,0:18:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know now that when she said she wanted\Nto help me with my work, it was sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.96,0:18:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mercy is outside the realm of etiquette.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.26,0:18:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you will either gain,\Nor you will suffer loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.90,0:18:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what is the proper\Nway to eat a cob of corn?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.56,0:18:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, would you care to\Ntry once more, Mr. Kishibe?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.24,0:18:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again, you are free to return\Nhome whenever you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.44,0:19:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate Rohan Kishibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.16,0:19:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The utensils you've\Nlaid out here before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.96,0:19:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is obvious that none of them\Nare suited for the task at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold as I answer you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.90,0:19:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satisfied yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.04,0:19:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should brace yourself first, and\Nthen look down when you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.78,0:19:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the rule-breaker now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.58,0:19:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'll admit, this\Nisn't the plot I envisioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.30,0:19:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But given the tight deadline, it\Nwas the best one I could write.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.30,0:19:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm speaking of my ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heaven's door.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.00,0:19:53.13,Note,Caption,0,0,0,,Note: "I cannot see the borders of tatami mats."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.28,0:19:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.34,0:19:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're doing it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.26,0:19:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a both feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:20:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an impressive\Npower, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.80,0:20:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do appreciate the lessons\Nyou gave me. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.86,0:20:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, on to the matter of what\NI gain, as per the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.56,0:20:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems my answer was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.48,0:20:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The proper way to eat a\Ncob of corn is by hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.64,0:20:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you owe my\Ncolleague something as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.16,0:20:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her beloved mother and boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.42,0:20:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an obscene trick. You...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.64,0:20:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will incur the wrath of the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.70,0:20:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.61,0:20:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kishibe, will you be\Nmaking another attempt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.58,0:20:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or would you prefer to call it\Na day and return home? My, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.70,0:20:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems the gods have no quarrel with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why would they, considering\Nyou're the one who violated the rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.00,0:20:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I choose to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.40,0:20:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't intend to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.32,0:21:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's one heck of a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.40,0:21:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.46,0:21:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so do you know what ended up happening to\Nthe editor lady's mother and boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.36,0:21:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were both perfectly fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.04,0:21:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were merely rear-ended,\Nwhich panicked a relative,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.32,0:21:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who then proceeded to sound a false alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.64,0:21:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is such a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.30,0:21:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, Koichi, I have\Nsome research to do after this,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.20,0:21:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and likely won't be back\Nuntil well after eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.44,0:21:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.42,0:21:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you're gonna go do research, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.78,0:21:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're looking up a way\Nto stop being a freeloader.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.50,0:21:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You make a very good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.98,0:21:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should work on finding a new\Nplace where I can draw freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.64,0:21:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sadly, I'm utterly broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.44,0:21:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to come to my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.16,0:21:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got plenty of rooms\Nyou could set up in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.98,0:21:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.89,0:21:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That does sound nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.70,0:22:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As it happens, your father is\Na topic of interest for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.58,0:22:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.76,0:22:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to do today, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.02,0:22:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe your heavens-whatever\Ncan turn him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.10,0:22:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you try it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.30,0:22:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must refuse. What?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.86,0:22:27.20,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I wanna know the truth of life that never ends
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.64,0:22:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To chain a mystic rise.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.20,0:22:32.41,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To unchain the mystic rites I'm calling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.46,0:22:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.58,0:22:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way to find.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.58,0:22:37.87,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'm on my way to find the eternal verities
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.90,0:22:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eternal valedictives.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.64,0:22:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exploding all their teardrops by the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.87,0:22:43.59,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Exploding all the teardrops by the sun
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.46,0:22:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel my heart feeling.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.59,0:22:48.93,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I can feel my heart beating
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.22,0:22:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see my face.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.93,0:22:59.48,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I can see my fate all spinning around beyond the time
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.08,0:22:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All spinning round.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.98,0:22:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beyond the storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.90,0:23:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rise up to the sky.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.48,0:23:04.77,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Rise up to the sky, like a butterfly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.04,0:23:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a butterfly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.26,0:23:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me what's inside.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.77,0:23:10.11,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Show me what's inside, don't ever let go
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.36,0:23:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know the world. Grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.94,0:23:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shining stars will guide me to.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.11,0:23:15.58,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Shining stars will guide me to somewhere high
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.70,0:23:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somewhere high.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.56,0:23:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finding the truth.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.58,0:23:21.46,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Finding the truth beyond the Heaven's Door
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.12,0:23:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beyond the heaven storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.98,0:24:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

